(5512062, 795684, 78371, '<td valign="top">Good on you for losing 70 lbs, that is tremendous to say the least. The colors are appropriately vibrant and I really like how the blue is reflected in the plate.  The food, especially the ice cream pops because of the color difference.  I think that the dof should be a <i>tiny</i> bit deeper, so that some of the strawberries on the cake would be in focus.</td>', 'Good on you for losing 70 lbs, that is tremendous to say the least. The colors are appropriately vibrant and I really like how the blue is reflected in the plate.  The food, especially the ice cream pops because of the color difference.  I think that the dof should be a tiny bit deeper, so that some of the strawberries on the cake would be in focus.', '2009-06-03 10:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
