(5514027, 795746, 32011, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Photo is good, but the girls face appears to be a little blown out by the flash.  The crop is a little too tight for my liking... loss of fingers is an issue for me.  Only other issue is the red eye... given it´s a basic editing challenge, the only real option would have been to use red eye reduction... 1. assuming your camera has it and 2. assuming you didn´t already use it and this is what you still got.  I like the concept and the idea, and I reckon this would have done much better if flash, crop, and red-eye´s were fixed.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Photo is good, but the girls face appears to be a little blown out by the flash.  The crop is a little too tight for my liking... loss of fingers is an issue for me.  Only other issue is the red eye... given it´s a basic editing challenge, the only real option would have been to use red eye reduction... 1. assuming your camera has it and 2. assuming you didn´t already use it and this is what you still got.  I like the concept and the idea, and I reckon this would have done much better if flash, crop, and red-eye´s were fixed.', '2009-06-04 13:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
