(5514542, 796209, 103032, '<td valign="top">Technical critique: very good, amazingly crisp, well focused.  Composition is fine for this topic/subject.  Maybe just a little fill light could improve the pic, but this is okay too.<br/>Artistic critique:  Ya, this meets the challenge.  The taunting expression of brother and the agonized sister are priceless.  9</td>', 'Technical critique: very good, amazingly crisp, well focused.  Composition is fine for this topic/subject.  Maybe just a little fill light could improve the pic, but this is okay too.Artistic critique:  Ya, this meets the challenge.  The taunting expression of brother and the agonized sister are priceless.  9', '2009-06-04 18:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
