(5514549, 796179, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  I kept looking at this pic.  My thoughts are that this is a "static" picture if you will; two "standing forces."  I was thinking the concept may have had a bigger impact creating an "action" pic, the staple remover removing a staple from a stack of papers.<br/>I was going to give it a 5 or 6, but you did your job with the image by making me spend a lot of time thinking about it, so an 8.</td>', 'I like the concept.  I kept looking at this pic.  My thoughts are that this is a "static" picture if you will; two "standing forces."  I was thinking the concept may have had a bigger impact creating an "action" pic, the staple remover removing a staple from a stack of papers.I was going to give it a 5 or 6, but you did your job with the image by making me spend a lot of time thinking about it, so an 8.', '2009-06-04 18:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
