(5517161, 795746, 57460, '<td valign="top">A little too much of a snapshot to me - especially with the use of the on board flash (even though i know it sometimes cannot be avoided).  I would not have seen the association to the challenge if it was not for your title.  Nice snapshot though!</td>', 'A little too much of a snapshot to me - especially with the use of the on board flash (even though i know it sometimes cannot be avoided).  I would not have seen the association to the challenge if it was not for your title.  Nice snapshot though!', '2009-06-06 17:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517163, 796182, 57460, '<td valign="top">Applies well the the challenge topic.  I don''t mind the cat being OOF, it kind of adds to the stalking aspect of it, but I wish you could have caught the lizards head in the photo, with it''s body a little more in focus - this would have been a captivating photo.  I do love your use of B/W - it sure makes the spots on the lizard stand out.</td>', 'Applies well the the challenge topic.  I don''t mind the cat being OOF, it kind of adds to the stalking aspect of it, but I wish you could have caught the lizards head in the photo, with it''s body a little more in focus - this would have been a captivating photo.  I do love your use of B/W - it sure makes the spots on the lizard stand out.', '2009-06-06 17:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5517165, 796133, 57460, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha!  I love this!  I love the DOF and your title sure does help add almost a story to the photo - I sure do see how it can relate to the comic!  Gotta love MAD!  Great job!</td>', 'Ha ha ha!  I love this!  I love the DOF and your title sure does help add almost a story to the photo - I sure do see how it can relate to the comic!  Gotta love MAD!  Great job!', '2009-06-06 17:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
