(5521903, 795682, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just coming off to me as a snapshot, I''m afraid. The statue is slightly cut off at the bottom, and the red door draws my eye away from the grey statue.  I think this one is also fighting the hard midday sun. That midday sun is the photographers enemy.</td>', 'Just coming off to me as a snapshot, I''m afraid. The statue is slightly cut off at the bottom, and the red door draws my eye away from the grey statue.  I think this one is also fighting the hard midday sun. That midday sun is the photographers enemy.', '2009-06-09 23:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
