(5521910, 795338, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice classic ''Vette. I love the ones with the fender flares. Sorry, but this comes off to me as a snapshot in harsh midday sun. The composition seems awkward, in that the vette is really close to the edge of the frame and the cop strikes me as too centered. I also see a ton of compression artifacts on and around the car and the cop''s hand. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'Nice classic ''Vette. I love the ones with the fender flares. Sorry, but this comes off to me as a snapshot in harsh midday sun. The composition seems awkward, in that the vette is really close to the edge of the frame and the cop strikes me as too centered. I also see a ton of compression artifacts on and around the car and the cop''s hand. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-06-09 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
