(5522092, 796165, 68504, '<td valign="top">OK, have to use the word "fetching" again.  It is a fetching picture, and I love the story.  Had a cat once whom late at night I heard purring loudly in my closet; he had brought in his kill - a bird - and just had to sound off his pleasure.</td>', 'OK, have to use the word "fetching" again.  It is a fetching picture, and I love the story.  Had a cat once whom late at night I heard purring loudly in my closet; he had brought in his kill - a bird - and just had to sound off his pleasure.', '2009-06-10 02:25:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5522096, 795741, 68504, '<td valign="top">I was enjoying this photograph, but found cutout''s and skewsme''s comments distracting.  I hope that''s relevant.  Anyway it makes me think of Kierkegaard or the movies of Ingmar Bergman from whom in whom there is no escape.</td>', 'I was enjoying this photograph, but found cutout''s and skewsme''s comments distracting.  I hope that''s relevant.  Anyway it makes me think of Kierkegaard or the movies of Ingmar Bergman from whom in whom there is no escape.', '2009-06-10 02:32:43.000000', NULL, 0),
