(5525570, 795790, 30896, '<td valign="top">seems like people were really scared or what, this is certainly not a sub 5 photo. though the amount of blood doesn''t correspond to the obvious fist fight. still it was 9 from me, as it conveys the "enmity" emotion really well, much better than most of the competition.</td>', 'seems like people were really scared or what, this is certainly not a sub 5 photo. though the amount of blood doesn''t correspond to the obvious fist fight. still it was 9 from me, as it conveys the "enmity" emotion really well, much better than most of the competition.', '2009-06-12 15:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5525690, 796245, 3936, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first, and very well deserved, blue.<br/> <br/>I''m really enjoying this image.  It has a sort of Norman Rockwell feel to it.  I could easily see it on the cover of one of the many magazines that grace our home when I was a child.<br/> <br/>Absolutely wonderful image.  Thanks for sharing the back story.  If anything it makes it even better.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first, and very well deserved, blue. I''m really enjoying this image.  It has a sort of Norman Rockwell feel to it.  I could easily see it on the cover of one of the many magazines that grace our home when I was a child. Absolutely wonderful image.  Thanks for sharing the back story.  If anything it makes it even better.', '2009-06-12 18:49:01.000000', NULL, 0),
