(5526706, 796155, 24454, '<td valign="top">OMG!  That is COOL!  This is aMAZING macro photography -- most definitely award worthy whether or not he is a true pest of that flower :)   Glad to find out he really is tho so you don''t have to feel bad.<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS!</td>', 'OMG!  That is COOL!  This is aMAZING macro photography -- most definitely award worthy whether or not he is a true pest of that flower :)   Glad to find out he really is tho so you don''t have to feel bad. CONGRATULATIONS!', '2009-06-13 16:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
